    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Devoted of Ynnead",
    "summary": "You can use these rules:\n\n- **Lethal Intent**: as [your opponent's Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) ends, if any **YNNARI** units of yours were **destroyed** in the phase, pick a **YNNARI INFANTRY** or **YNNARI MOUNTED** unit of yours that was up to 6\" from one of those destroyed units. That unit can move up to D6+1\" as a [Normal move](vsdata:core-rule/normal-move).\n- **Lethal Surge**: up to once per turn, if a **YNNARI** unit of yours performs Fade Back, then in place of the Normal move, it can move up to D6+1\" as a [surge move](vsdata:core-rule/surge-move).\n- **Lethal Reprisal**: as [either player's Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) begins, pick a **YNNARI** unit of yours, other than a **TITANIC** unit, that is under its [Starting Strength](vsdata:core-rule/units-and-models). That unit gets [Fights First](vsdata:core-ability/fights-first) for the rest of the phase.",
